ng incident #MeToo. #YouToo. #WeToo https:\/\/t.co\/tNMtmkUiQb via @IndianExpose","userId":1890327224,"media":null,"username":"PrinceArihan","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":8,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1049729995789230087","date":1539110108000,"rawContent":"There are some people sharing this image. You insensitive people. Do you think that sexual abuse and harassment is bloody joke. Have you ever been violated? Has anyone in your family been violated? People have started #MeToo for some justice. If you cannot support, sit quiet. https:\/\/t.co\/wYePB23LHL","userId":1890327224,"media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/DpFj0STXcAY2wZg?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"PrinceArihan","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":9,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1049842173078855680","date":1539136853000,"rawContent":"How can you judge a movement by what yardsticks? Have you investigated any of the cases? How do you arrive at such biases? What is the difference between those slandering then Nun and those slandering the #MeToo complaints.","userId":1890327224,"media":null,"username":"PrinceArihan","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":10,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1049842834780622849","date":1539137011000,"rawContent":"Sexual abuse is real threat. You may not like #MeToo movement and arrive at your own bias. But there is the evil in society, I have seen it closely. I am sure many have but chose to close their eyes. https:\/\/t.co\/Mic7V0QeZu","userId":1890327224,"media":null,"username":"PrinceArihan","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":11,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1049845152016154625","date":1539137564000,"rawContent":"#MeToo is not a movement to shame India. There are many cases that will find a voice but it is in collective voices that a noise is formed. #MeToo in India happens everyday to thousands of children, women and men. It also happens all around world.","userId":1890327224,"media":null,"username":"PrinceArihan","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":12,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1049869220228620294","date":1539143302000,"rawContent":"Of course in din of sexual abuse allegations there will some dubious complaints. Should we then prefer victims remain silent rather than open their mouths and speak the truth. Let investigations decide the truth. #MeToo","userId":1890327224,"media":null,"username":"PrinceArihan","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":13,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLives